{"seq":1,"slug":"code-signing","title":"代码签名与描述文件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/deployment/code-signing","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码签名与描述文件\">代码签名与描述文件</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>代码签名是 iOS 应用从开发到分发的<strong>信任基石</strong>——Apple 通过签名机制确保每个安装到设备上的 App 都来自已识别的开发者，且代码未被篡改。理解证书（Certificate）、描述文件（Provisioning Profile）和权限声明（Entitlements）三者的关系，是团队协作开发和自动化构建的前提。</p>\n<p>签名流程涉及 Apple Developer Portal、本地 Keychain 和 Xcode 三方交互，手动管理容易出错。fastlane match 等工具将证书和描述文件集中存储在 Git 仓库或云端，实现团队共享和 CI/CD 自动化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DEV[&quot;Apple Developer Account&quot;] --&gt; CERT[&quot;Certificate Certificate&quot;]&#10;    DEV --&gt; PROFILE[&quot;Provisioning Profile Provisioning Profile&quot;]&#10;    CERT --&gt; SIGN[&quot;Code Signing Code Signing&quot;]&#10;    PROFILE --&gt; SIGN&#10;    ENT[&quot;Entitlements Entitlements&quot;] --&gt; SIGN&#10;    SIGN --&gt; IPA[&quot;Signed .ipa&quot;]&#10;    IPA --&gt; DEVICE[&quot;Device Install / App Store&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    DEV[\"Apple Developer Account\"] --&gt; CERT[\"Certificate Certificate\"]\n    DEV --&gt; PROFILE[\"Provisioning Profile Provisioning Profile\"]\n    CERT --&gt; SIGN[\"Code Signing Code Signing\"]\n    PROFILE --&gt; SIGN\n    ENT[\"Entitlements Entitlements\"] --&gt; SIGN\n    SIGN --&gt; IPA[\"Signed .ipa\"]\n    IPA --&gt; DEVICE[\"Device Install / App Store\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码签名的本质是<strong>信任链</strong>：Apple 用证书证明「你是被识别的开发者」，用描述文件把证书、App ID、设备与权限绑定在一起，最终让系统确认「这个包可信、允许安装」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三要素</strong>：证书（身份）、描述文件（授权绑定）、Entitlements（权限声明）缺一不可</li>\n<li><strong>匹配一致</strong>：Entitlements 必须与 Developer Portal 中 App ID 的 Capabilities 一致</li>\n<li><strong>可集中管理</strong>：<code>fastlane match</code> 把签名资源集中存储，供团队与 CI 共享</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">要素</th>\n<th align=\"left\">作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Certificate</td>\n<td align=\"left\">证明开发者身份，分开发 / 分发两类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Provisioning Profile</td>\n<td align=\"left\">绑定证书、App ID、设备与权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Entitlements</td>\n<td align=\"left\">声明应用需要的系统权限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心工具\">核心工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Apple Developer Portal</strong></td>\n<td>管理证书、App ID、描述文件、设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Keychain Access</strong></td>\n<td>存储签名证书和私钥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Xcode</strong></td>\n<td>自动/手动签名配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>fastlane match</strong></td>\n<td>团队证书同步与 CI/CD 自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>codesign</strong></td>\n<td>命令行签名工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>security</strong></td>\n<td>命令行 Keychain 操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"证书类型\">证书类型</h3><p>iOS 开发中有两类核心证书：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证书类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>有效期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Development</strong></td>\n<td>真机调试、开发阶段测试</td>\n<td>1 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Distribution</strong></td>\n<td>App Store / Ad Hoc / Enterprise 分发</td>\n<td>1 年（Enterprise 3 年）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每个证书由一对公私钥组成——私钥保存在本地 Keychain，公钥以 <code>.cer</code> 形式上传到 Apple Portal。创建证书时需要先生成 CSR（Certificate Signing Request）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"描述文件-provisioning-profile\">描述文件（Provisioning Profile）</h3><p>描述文件将<strong>证书</strong>、<strong>App ID</strong>、<strong>设备列表</strong>和<strong>权限</strong>绑定在一起：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CERT[&quot;Signing Certificate&quot;] --&gt; PP[&quot;Provisioning Profile&quot;]&#10;    APPID[&quot;App ID (Bundle ID)&quot;] --&gt; PP&#10;    DEVICES[&quot;Device UDID List&quot;] --&gt; PP&#10;    ENT[&quot;Entitlements&quot;] --&gt; PP&#10;    PP --&gt; BUILD[&quot;Xcode Build Archive&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    CERT[\"Signing Certificate\"] --&gt; PP[\"Provisioning Profile\"]\n    APPID[\"App ID (Bundle ID)\"] --&gt; PP\n    DEVICES[\"Device UDID List\"] --&gt; PP\n    ENT[\"Entitlements\"] --&gt; PP\n    PP --&gt; BUILD[\"Xcode Build Archive\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>描述文件类型</th>\n<th>包含设备列表</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Development</strong></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Ad Hoc</strong></td>\n<td>✅（最多 100 台）</td>\n<td>内部测试分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>App Store</strong></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>提交 App Store / TestFlight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Enterprise (In-House)</strong></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>企业内部分发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"entitlements-权限声明\">Entitlements（权限声明）</h3><p>Entitlements 是嵌入到签名中的键值对，声明 App 需要的系统能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// MyApp.entitlements (XML plist)&#10;// 常见权限项：&#10;// com.apple.developer.applesignin        → Sign in with Apple&#10;// com.apple.security.application-groups   → App Groups 共享数据&#10;// aps-environment                         → 推送通知 (development/production)&#10;// com.apple.developer.associated-domains  → Universal Links&#10;// keychain-access-groups                  → Keychain 共享\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MyApp.entitlements (XML plist)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 常见权限项：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// com.apple.developer.applesignin        → Sign in with Apple</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// com.apple.security.application-groups   → App Groups 共享数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// aps-environment                         → 推送通知 (development/production)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// com.apple.developer.associated-domains  → Universal Links</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// keychain-access-groups                  → Keychain 共享</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"xcode-自动签名-vs-手动签名\">Xcode 自动签名 vs 手动签名</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Choose Signing Method&quot;] --&gt; AUTO[&quot;Automatic Signing Automatically manage signing&quot;]&#10;    START --&gt; MANUAL[&quot;Manual Signing Manual&quot;]&#10;    AUTO --&gt; XCODE[&quot;Xcode Auto create/update certs &amp; profiles&quot;]&#10;    XCODE --&gt; DEV_OK[&quot;For individual dev/small teams ✅&quot;]&#10;    MANUAL --&gt; SELECT[&quot;Manually select Provisioning Profile&quot;]&#10;    SELECT --&gt; CI_OK[&quot;For CI/CD / large teams ✅&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Choose Signing Method\"] --&gt; AUTO[\"Automatic Signing Automatically manage signing\"]\n    START --&gt; MANUAL[\"Manual Signing Manual\"]\n    AUTO --&gt; XCODE[\"Xcode Auto create/update certs &amp; profiles\"]\n    XCODE --&gt; DEV_OK[\"For individual dev/small teams ✅\"]\n    MANUAL --&gt; SELECT[\"Manually select Provisioning Profile\"]\n    SELECT --&gt; CI_OK[\"For CI/CD / large teams ✅\"]</pre><p>自动签名在 Xcode 的 Signing &amp; Capabilities 中启用 <code>Automatically manage signing</code>，Xcode 会根据 Team 和 Bundle ID 自动创建或更新所需的证书和描述文件。手动签名需要在 Apple Developer Portal 中提前创建好对应的描述文件，然后在 Xcode 中手动选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"企业分发\">企业分发</h3><p>Enterprise 证书（Apple Developer Enterprise Program）允许绑定不限设备数量的 In-House 描述文件，用于公司内部分发，无需经过 App Store 审核。但 Apple 对企业证书的滥用监管严格，一旦检测到面向公众分发可能吊销证书。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fastlane-match\">fastlane match</h3><p>fastlane match 将证书和描述文件集中存储在 Git 仓库（或 Google Cloud Storage / S3），团队成员和 CI 机器共享同一套签名资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ruby\" data-code=\"# Matchfile&#10;git_url(&quot;https://github.com/myteam/certificates&quot;)&#10;storage_mode(&quot;git&quot;)&#10;type(&quot;appstore&quot;)&#10;app_identifier([&quot;com.myteam.app&quot;, &quot;com.myteam.app.widget&quot;])&#10;username(&quot;ci@myteam.com&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Matchfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/myteam/certificates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">storage_mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"git\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"appstore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">app_identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.myteam.app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.myteam.app.widget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ci@myteam.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 团队成员首次同步&#10;fastlane match development&#10;fastlane match appstore&#10;&#10;# CI 环境（只读模式，不创建新证书）&#10;fastlane match appstore --readonly\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 团队成员首次同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fastlane</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> development</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fastlane</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> appstore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 环境（只读模式，不创建新证书）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fastlane</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> appstore</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --readonly</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战演示\">实战演示</h2><p>一个完整的签名配置示例——从命令行验证签名信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看已安装的签名身份&#10;security find-identity -v -p codesigning&#10;&#10;# 查看 .ipa 的签名信息&#10;codesign -dv --verbose=4 MyApp.app&#10;&#10;# 查看描述文件内容&#10;security cms -D -i embedded.mobileprovision&#10;&#10;# 重新签名（替换描述文件后）&#10;codesign -f -s &quot;Apple Distribution: My Team (TEAMID)&quot; \\&#10;  --entitlements MyApp.entitlements \\&#10;  MyApp.app\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看已安装的签名身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> find-identity</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> codesigning</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 .ipa 的签名信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">codesign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -dv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose=4</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MyApp.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看描述文件内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cms</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> embedded.mobileprovision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重新签名（替换描述文件后）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">codesign</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Apple Distribution: My Team (TEAMID)\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --entitlements</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MyApp.entitlements</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  MyApp.app</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Xcode 项目中使用 xcconfig 管理多环境签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// Debug.xcconfig&#10;CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic&#10;DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDEF1234&#10;CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development&#10;PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER =&#10;&#10;// Release.xcconfig&#10;CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual&#10;DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDEF1234&#10;CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Distribution&#10;PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER = MyApp_AppStore_Profile\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Debug.xcconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDEF1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Release.xcconfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDEF1234</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Distribution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER = MyApp_AppStore_Profile</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见问题\">常见问题</h2><h3 id=\"问题一-构建时报-no-signing-certificate-错误\">问题一：构建时报 &quot;No signing certificate&quot; 错误</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：Keychain 中缺少对应的私钥，或证书已过期。</p>\n<p><strong>解决</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>检查 Keychain Access 中是否有对应的证书和关联私钥</li>\n<li>如果使用 match，运行 <code>fastlane match development</code> 重新同步</li>\n<li>如果证书过期，在 Apple Developer Portal 中撤销旧证书并创建新证书</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"问题二-描述文件不包含当前设备\">问题二：描述文件不包含当前设备</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：Ad Hoc 或 Development 描述文件未包含目标设备的 UDID。</p>\n<p><strong>解决</strong>：在 Apple Developer Portal 的 Devices 中注册设备 UDID，然后重新生成描述文件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"问题三-entitlements-不匹配\">问题三：Entitlements 不匹配</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：项目中的 <code>.entitlements</code> 文件声明的权限与描述文件中的 capabilities 不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>解决</strong>：确保 Apple Developer Portal 中 App ID 的 Capabilities 与本地 <code>.entitlements</code> 文件一致，然后重新生成描述文件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"问题四-ci-环境签名失败\">问题四：CI 环境签名失败</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：CI 机器的 Keychain 被锁定或无法访问。</p>\n<p><strong>解决</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CI 脚本中解锁 Keychain&#10;security unlock-keychain -p &quot;$KEYCHAIN_PASSWORD&quot; ~/Library/Keychains/login.keychain-db&#10;security set-keychain-settings -t 3600 ~/Library/Keychains/login.keychain-db\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI 脚本中解锁 Keychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unlock-keychain</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$KEYCHAIN_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Library/Keychains/login.keychain-db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">security</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-keychain-settings</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/Library/Keychains/login.keychain-db</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"问题五-多-target-签名配置混乱\">问题五：多 Target 签名配置混乱</h3><p><strong>原因</strong>：主 App、Widget Extension、Notification Extension 等使用不同的 Bundle ID 和描述文件。</p>\n<p><strong>解决</strong>：为每个 Target 创建独立的描述文件，在 fastlane match 中用数组指定所有 <code>app_identifier</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>证书</strong>分为 Development（调试）和 Distribution（分发）两类，私钥存储在本地 Keychain，需妥善备份。</li>\n<li><strong>描述文件</strong>将证书、App ID、设备列表、权限绑定在一起，不同分发方式使用不同类型。</li>\n<li><strong>Entitlements</strong> 声明 App 需要的系统权限，必须与 Apple Developer Portal 中的 App ID Capabilities 一致。</li>\n<li><strong>自动签名</strong>适合个人开发和小团队，<strong>手动签名</strong>适合 CI/CD 和大团队协作。</li>\n<li><strong>Enterprise 分发</strong>用于公司内部，无需 App Store 审核，但严禁面向公众分发。</li>\n<li><strong>fastlane match</strong> 将签名资源集中在 Git 仓库，团队共享同一套证书和描述文件，CI 使用 <code>--readonly</code> 模式。</li>\n<li>在 CI 环境中需要注意 Keychain 解锁、证书安装和描述文件路径配置。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>codesign</code> 和 <code>security</code> 命令行工具可以排查签名问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码签名与描述文件","id":"代码签名与描述文件"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心工具","id":"核心工具"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"证书类型","id":"证书类型"},{"level":3,"text":"描述文件（Provisioning Profile）","id":"描述文件-provisioning-profile"},{"level":3,"text":"Entitlements（权限声明）","id":"entitlements-权限声明"},{"level":3,"text":"Xcode 自动签名 vs 手动签名","id":"xcode-自动签名-vs-手动签名"},{"level":3,"text":"企业分发","id":"企业分发"},{"level":3,"text":"fastlane match","id":"fastlane-match"},{"level":2,"text":"实战演示","id":"实战演示"},{"level":2,"text":"常见问题","id":"常见问题"},{"level":3,"text":"问题一：构建时报 \"No signing certificate\" 错误","id":"问题一-构建时报-no-signing-certificate-错误"},{"level":3,"text":"问题二：描述文件不包含当前设备","id":"问题二-描述文件不包含当前设备"},{"level":3,"text":"问题三：Entitlements 不匹配","id":"问题三-entitlements-不匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"问题四：CI 环境签名失败","id":"问题四-ci-环境签名失败"},{"level":3,"text":"问题五：多 Target 签名配置混乱","id":"问题五-多-target-签名配置混乱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"隐私清单与 ATT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/security-and-privacy/privacy-manifest"},"next":{"title":"TestFlight 内测分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/deployment/testflight"}}